// Pick the newest snapshot among the canonical file and the gen/epoch
// scoped files. Generation is the primary order; within one generation a
// higher epoch wins, so a preempted holder's late snapshot rename can
// never eclipse the current owner's. The unscoped canonical file (older
// buses, hand-crafted crash fixtures) counts as epoch 0.
